  "details": "## Description\n\nWhen the webpage for the bug report opens from the View In Browser prompt, the page rejects access saying \"You do not have permission to access this page.\" and the bug report cannot be viewed.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\n1. Submit bug in-game\u000b2. follow prompt to view in browser\u000bExpected behavior: resulting webpage is viewable\n\nCurrent behavior: \"You do not have permission to access this page.\"\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1878-c608353bf2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-07-22_20-27-07.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_1dfe3236-25f1-4089-8a08-7816138b47c9/1/file)",
